@startuml F7.1-D03-desativar-usuario
title F7.1-D03 — Desativar usuário
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "IAMController" as Ctrl
participant "DeactivateUserUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Confirmar desativar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /admin/usuarios/{id}/desativar
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE INATIVO\n+ jti_blacklist\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Admin: badge Inativo

@enduml
